{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1097127-chronicles-of-darkness-eroding-shadows-crossover-actual-play","id":1097127,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness: Eroding Shadows Crossover (Actual Play)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-26T08:15:46-07:00","id":1097127,"title":"Chronicles of Darkness: Eroding Shadows Crossover (Actual Play)","content":"[W.I.P - Will Update when I can]<br /> <br /> Introduction: So I've been wanting to find a solid medium to record my session notes of the previous session along with sharing them, so I thought this would be a fair medium to do it. Inspiration comes from <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar56_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"56\" data-vbnamecard=\"56\">Baroness Nerak</a>'s various Actual Play threads - Thanks for the inspiration <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Eroding Shadows took place and began in modern day Seattle, Washington on September 1st, 2016. A great deal of events have happened that haven't been fully recorded in a published medium, however I will have summary notes on the adventures/journeys that the PCs have gone on. At the time of this writing, the current date is Monday, December 19th, 2016. The game originally began as a mortal game, however various people got involved in different facets of the Supernatural society. Eroding Shadows is my attempt at overlaying all the various elements from the Chronicle games into one functioning ecosystem. The game is heavily sandboxy with the PCs having free will to engage and come together from all different walks of life and backgrounds, working together to achieve common goals.<br /> <br /> The campaign uses 2nd edition rules when applicable, however I use many homebrew elements/heavily modified 1E rules when applicable or elements created by other storytellers that I've received inspiration on - I plan on having an inspirational section below.<br /> <br /> Our current cast consists of:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://puu.sh/w1QQP/c6fa2b9e1d.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Jay Harper</a> (Vampire)<br /> Clan: Ventrue<br /> Covenant: N/A<br /> <br /> Jay Harper, age 26, was born and raised in Philadelphia. He was born the son of a high profile CEO, working in pharmaceuticals. In 2014 he graduated from Yale, and decided to move to Seattle, to seek new opportunities, with ambitions to become a district prosecutor. Various events entered his life which led to him becoming a ghoul, and later embraced. He is prideful, determined, but also quite stubborn in his approaches.<br /> <br /> <b>Fia Gray</b> (L\u2019Enfants Diabolique from Demon: Inferno)<br /> Demon: Succubus<br /> Cult: N/A<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Fia is 22 years old, born on the 18th of March 1994. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">She moved to Seattle with her father when she was 13 years old after her mother mysteriously passed away. The mysterious death of her mother ignited her passion for medicine and care. Home-schooled by her father, she is being trained to be a nurse at the Northwest Hospital and Medical Center where he is the Head Neurologist. She has a natural talent for care and has an excellent relationship with most of her patients. Various events IG entered her life in which she discovered she was a half-blooded demon child. She is kind, compassionate, and caring, but has been slowly been affected by the influences of the others and her experiences.<br /> <br /> <b>Lyle Garcia </b>(Vampire)<br /> Clan: Ventrue<br /> Covenant: N/A</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">A 24 year old student from San Francisco. Lyle has lived a difficult life. Due to high living costs, he was forced to move out of State. He moved to Seattle at the age of 19 to go to school and work. After his father passed away, his life insurance left him with a bit of money to spend. So after buying a car, paying his student debt, and paying for a small apartment and some left over. He decided to live it out in Settle in hopes of making his own personal business. </span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Fast forward a few year and Lyle is almost finish with his Masters. He lives happily. He's even began to like football. Turns out Washington wasn't so bad after all. Due to the various events IG, he ended up becoming a Kindred, in which he tries to understand what he is and tie up loose ends.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b>Carlos Calybre</b> (Awakened Mage)<br /> Path: Moros<br /> Order: N/A<br /> Much of Carlos' past is unknown and hidden from the others, however he led a drug cartel and aimed to spread his influence across the United States. When questioned on his past he would only say his aims are &quot;To retrieve what is rightfully mine.&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Neal Lawrence</b> (Stigmatic)<br /> At one time Neal was a colleague to the group, he left the group to seek out his own destiny. His aims are to create a global conspiracy of Hunters, one that dwarfs even Task Force Valkyrie and Lazarus Inc.<br /> <br /> <b>Damocles</b> (Unchained Demon)<br /> Incarnation: Destroyer<br /> Agenda: Tempter<br /> Most of Damocles' past is left in mystery, however he currently possesses two covers. Ryan Gora, a police detective for the Seattle PD<br /> <br /> <b>Doctor Elric Bradley</b> (Kindred)<br /> Clan: Ventrue<br /> Covenant: Ordo Dracul<br /> <br /> <b>Sebek </b>(Arisen)<br /> Decree: Ren<br /> Guild: Maa-Kep, the Engravers of Amulets<br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Sebek, born an unspecified period of time in Ancient Irem. </span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Last awaking due to the most recent Sothic Turn a month and a half ago. this event has allowed him the most freedom to pursuit things that give him interest. Mostly comes in the forms of gathering knowledge and uncovering secrets. Though he still will punish those who deify Khem-Inhu </span></span><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">Sebek is somewhat aloof and many of his memories are hazy, and incomplete, however he is still driven by an interest in knowledge and sees the Sothic Turn as an opportunity to uncover his past. </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#404040\">A small cult is currently following in the form of a small tech start up company that operates in downtown Seattle. Though, not compelled to aid them, he wishes to see them succeed in their endeavors. He works with the other PCs to recover his past, and make sense of the world around him. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#404040\">The first post below is a brief and condensed summary of the various arcs &amp; story-lines the PCs took part in between September 1st - December 19th.<br /> <br /> I use or have received inspiration from various works I have found on the forums, and I wish to give thanks to these people below.<br /> <br /> Baroness Nerak - I already mentioned above, but the entire idea to chronicle the whole story was from your actual play threads, particularly Geist: Balance of Shadows &amp; Demon: Night Train Detective Agency. I try to follow it, but I'm a bit behind. Fantastic writing, keep it up <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar148_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"148\" data-vbnamecard=\"148\">PenDragon</a> - I use your homebrew CofD hack for Mummies. It is very effective and has helped me greatly. Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":". 05-26-2017, 01:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-26T08:27:56-07:00","id":1097133,"title":"","content":"Summary Notes<br /> September - December 19th<br /> <br /> September Events<br /> <br /> September 1st - <b>Introduction to the Horrors of the World:</b> The main original cast of Jay, Fia, Lyle, Jackson, and Riviera were trapped in a hospital. After surviving horrific horrors - they found out the catastrophe had been caused by a monster; one that was known for his white sparkly suit, Corbin.<br /> <br /> September 4th - <b>The First Hunt:</b> The characters took it on themselves to discover more about the world around them. They began working as a paranormal investigation company, which led them to their first case. There was supposedly a large wolf-like creature that was seen in a small neighbourhood. Investigation into this found that there was a woman who practiced in dark magic. This dark magic had led to the creation of this furry creature who was later disccovered to be a giant rat known as Fetch. A fight ensued and it led to the death of the woman and her large giant pet, Fetch.<br /> <br /> September 6th - <b>The Magnus House:</b> The cast began to investigate a haunted house. The haunted house was revealed to be owned by James Magnus, a cynical evil ghost who sought to kill any who stepped on his lot or stopped his twisted games. The cast ended up burning his house and running away from the property.<br /> <br /> September 9th - <b>Newcastle Cemetery:</b> The cast investigated a spooky cemetery in which rumors spread of corpses rising. Investigation led to the meeting of a Sin-Eater, Gabriel and a necromancer named Matthew Williams. Gabriel and the cast teamed up, killing Matthew and his necrotic army.<br /> <br /> September 12th - <b>Investigation of the Essence:</b> The cast went to gain more intel on the white-suit Kindred. They discovered that there was a night club called the Essence, in which was a feasting ground for the vampires. Scouting into the situation, this led to both Jay &amp; Lyle becoming ghouled by Kindred: Lance &amp; Abby.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11457,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","user":"Volke","date":". 05-26-2017, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11457-volke","name":"Volke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11457_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}